Equations applied (paper screenshots):
  Eq (1)  Static efficiency   ηs = Q(H1-H2) / P_sh
  Eq (2)  Fan affinity power  P1/P2 = (N1/N2)^3
  Eq (3)  Fan affinity head   H1/H2 = (N1/N2)^2
  Eq (4)  Fan affinity flow   Q1/Q2 = N1/N2
  Eq (5)  Payback period      PBP = C_TE / C_TS
  Eq (6)  Fan energy use      E_Fan = T_o x L_F x W_F
  Eq (7)  Energy saved        ES_Fan = T_o x SP_F x W_F
  Eq (8)  GHG reduction       ER_GHG = ES_Fan x sum(F% x E_F)

Countries: India, USA, China
"""

